{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49883","headline":"生查子 · 刘侍读","name":"生查子","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"深秋更漏长，滴尽银台烛。\n独步出幽闺，月晃波澄绿。\n菱荷风乍触，一对鸳鸯宿。\n虚櫂玉钗惊，惊起还相续。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘侍读","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49883.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49883","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}